SUMMARY:Author Talk: Lauren Klein and Tanvi Sharma on "Data by Design"
LOCATION:Boston Public Library\, 700 Boylston Street\, Boston\, MA 02116
DESCRIPTION:Join visualization historian Lauren Klein and designer Tanvi Sh
 arma for a conversation about their new book Data by Design: Visualization
  and Power from Abolition to the Dawn of Data Science. The book returns to
  the history of data visualization to expose the power of charts and maps
 —and to show how they can be used for social change. Lauren and Tanvi wi
 ll be in conversation with Arvind Satyanarayan\, a professor of data visua
 lization at MIT.\nhttps://bpl.bibliocommons.com/events/6ab2828eda318a10e63
 5d936\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://bpl.bibliocommons.com/events/6ab2828eda318a10e635d936
