SUMMARY:Archaeology in Allston-Brighton
LOCATION:Brighton Library\, 40 Academy Hill Rd\, Brighton\, MA 02135
DESCRIPTION:Join the City of Boston Archaeology Program in exploring Allsto
 n-Brighton's history from the ground up! Learn about how archaeologists ch
 oose where to dig\, what excavation has already happened in Allston-Bright
 on\, which parts of the neighborhood may have potential for archaeology\, 
 and what you can do to protect these finite and irreplaceable historic res
 ources.\nhttps://bpl.bibliocommons.com/events/6ace695c035faf0033dc598c\nFr
 om Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
